"Archibald Carisson is an old SkySea Guard official who buys runaway news from Elias."
"He says every Avowed who escapes the island sets back Anesidora's global relations."
"He is a Water Shaper, once one of Anesidora's best, and Vandy Carisson's grandfather."
"He has been Elias's friend for half a century; in the flood he shoved the sea back."
